Description: feature-rich WhatsApp Web client for the desktop
 Whatsie is a Qt 6 / QtWebEngine desktop client for WhatsApp Web. It wraps the
 web app with native desktop integration:
 .
  * system tray with an unread badge and native notifications
  * light/dark themes synced with WhatsApp Web, plus zoom and interface scaling
  * a passcode app lock, message blur and per-site permission control
  * a downloads manager, with drag-and-drop and paste of attachments
  * spell check, network proxy, autostart and multiple-account profiles
